Reference corpus
The references/ folder summarises and quotes the Thai Basic Education Core
Curriculum B.E. 2551 (revised B.E. 2560) science indicators and IPST manuals,
the OECD PISA 2025 science framework, and Rawson (2021) on Steiner Waldorf
upper-school pedagogy, for teaching use. Those sources remain the property of
their owners; each reference file cites its source.
